I've been under the impression that temple priestesses are difficult to kill.
I am playing a priest (XP level 12, AC -30, speed boots, ~+5 Stormbringer)
and I came across a lawful temple (I'm still neutral).  So I decided to see
just how mean the priestess  was.  I was also under the impression that
she would have much gold, so I could take that to my own priestess.
Three or four hits and I killed her. She did no damage to me.  I don't have
magic resistance.  Any other stories about killing priestesses?  Are they
usually this easy to kill?  Oh, and this priestess had no gold, but 
three spellbooks and mediocre armor.



